MODULE: MaterialisedWhenCleanPublishOldRows
TARGET: MaterialisedWhenClean
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: materialisation clears its work flag without publishing the regrouped numeric rows
PERTURBS: Materialise

--- FIND
    /\ materialised' = [materialised EXCEPT ![g] = sums[g]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ materialised' = materialised
--- END
